# --- CD-5 Gate-2: the real `claude` native binary, staged into the
# Docker build context by deployment/docker/api/prepare-claude-binary.sh
# immediately before `docker compose build` — never committed (it is a
# large, host-specific binary artifact, not source; see that script's
# own docstring for why it is prepared this way rather than downloaded
# inside the Dockerfile). ---
deployment/docker/api/bin/

